# Scenario 'forced_screens' (FORCED execution, published under traces/forced/, never part of the natural union): unreferenced screens and helper routines of the mail /
# address-book / graphics code, entered with the harness directive `force BB:AAAA` (docs/research/dynamic_tracing.md, section 11) after a power cycle and the boot to the logo
# screen (the machine spins in a WRAM stub once the routine returns, so nothing but the forced code runs):
#   1. 2B:53C3 MailGrid_Screen: the unused "もらったメール" 4x3 grid of the received mails (records of SRAM bank 0: icons, date, name, title), cursor moves, A on a cell.
#   2. 7F:4C78 the text-canvas demo: 12 lines of the sample sentence "サンプルデータですからね～" on a 1-bit canvas, A redraws it inverted, B returns.
#   3. 4E:4000 (A = style) the screen-frame style chooser with its wipe animation (the loader 4E:6291 copies the map to SRAM bank 3 $B000).
#   4. 2D:4195 MailRecord_InstallSampleMails: writes five sample mails into records 0-4 of the mailbox; after a reset the ordinary メールボックス shows them.
#   5. 2D:44FB Abook_InstallSampleEntries: writes six sample address-book entries; after a reset the アドレスちょう list shows them.
#   6. 2D:7E60 Sram_ClearAllBanks: zeroes $A000-$BFFF of SRAM banks 0-3; after a reset the boot sees an all-zero cartridge.
# Starts from the state left by 'mail_inbox' (mails in the mailbox). Screen names = my reading of the screenshots.
reset
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
force 2B:53C3
wait 240
shot grid1
tap RIGHT
wait 60
tap DOWN
wait 60
tap RIGHT x2
wait 60
tap DOWN
wait 60
tap LEFT
wait 60
tap UP
wait 60
shot grid2
tap A
wait 240
shot grid3
tap B
wait 200
shot grid4
reset
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
force 7F:4C78
wait 300
shot canvas1
tap A
wait 200
shot canvas2
tap B
wait 200
shot canvas3
reset
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
force 4E:4000 A=03
wait 300
shot frame1
tap A
wait 100
shot frame2
tap B
wait 100
shot frame3
reset
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
force 2D:4195
wait 100
reset
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap DOWN x2
wait 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot samples_list
tap A
wait 60
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot samples_sender
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot samples_body
reset
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
force 2D:44FB
wait 100
reset
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap DOWN x3
wait 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot abook_samples
tap A
wait 60
tap RIGHT
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot abook_sample_view
reset
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
force 2D:7E60
wait 100
reset
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 900
shot cleared_1
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot cleared_2
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot cleared_3
